%N A172586 Number of 5*n X n 0..1 arrays with row sums 2 and column sums 10.
%D A172586 Gao, Shanzhen, and Matheis, Kenneth, Closed formulas and integer sequences arising from the enumeration of (0,1)-matrices with row sum two and some constant column sums. In Proceedings of the Forty-First Southeastern International Conference on Combinatorics, Graph Theory and Computing. Congr. Numer. 202 (2010), 45-53.
%H A172586 Vaclav Kotesovec, <a href="/A172586/b172586.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..50</a> (terms 1..19 from R. H. Hardin)
%F A172586 a(n) ~ sqrt(Pi) * 5^(8*n + 1/2) * n^(10*n + 1/2) / (2^(3*n-1) * 3^(4*n) * 7^n * exp(10*n + 9/2)). - _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Oct 12 2026
%t A172586 Table[(5*n)!/2^(5*n) * Sum[Sum[Sum[Sum[Sum[n!*(-1)^(-4*r1 - 3*r2 - 2*r3 - r4 + 5*n - 5*r0) * (10*r0 + 8*r1 + 6*r2 + 4*r3 + 2*r4)! / (r0!*r1!*r2!*r3!*r4! * (n - r0 - r1 - r2 - r3 - r4)! * (5*n + 4*r1 + 3*r2 + 2*r3 + r4 - 5*n + 5*r0)! * 120^n * 30240^r0 * 336^r1 * 12^r2 * 5^(-r3 - r4) * 6^r3 * 2^r4), {r4, 0, n - r0 - r1 - r2 - r3}], {r3, 0, n - r0 - r1 - r2}], {r2, 0, n - r0 - r1}], {r1, 0, n - r0}], {r0, 0, n}], {n, 1, 10}] (* _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Oct 12 2026, after _Shanzhen Gao_ *)
